{"unit_id":"shinji00222__dsh-windows-computer-use#card-zh","repo":"shinji00222/dsh-windows-computer-use","commit":"33d281ab5bc9ac2e8fc16a86379cfbb17b5fe192","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Windows 电脑控制是面向 Windows 桌面的 DSH Desktop 插件，通过 MCP 工具连接 C# 原生引擎，读取窗口、UI Automation 控件、OCR 文字和截图，并执行点击、输入及窗口操作。主要功能包括纯文本控件观察与最多八步的批量填写、需要图片模型的截图批处理、操作历史查询，以及遇到验证码等情况时请求用户接手。适合在 Windows 电脑上让 DSH 协助填写表单和操作桌面应用；需 Windows 环境，截图批处理需支持图片输入的模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/adapter/plugin.ts:1","src/adapter/server.ts:1","src/adapter/text-schema.ts:4","src/adapter/batch-schema.ts:12"]}
{"unit_id":"shinji00222__dsh-windows-computer-use#card-en","repo":"shinji00222/dsh-windows-computer-use","commit":"33d281ab5bc9ac2e8fc16a86379cfbb17b5fe192","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Windows Computer Use connects DSH Desktop to a native Windows engine. It reads UI controls, OCR text and screenshots, then performs desktop actions. Users can fill forms with text batches, run image based action batches, review operation history, and request a human handoff.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/adapter/plugin.ts:1","src/adapter/server.ts:1","src/adapter/text-schema.ts:4","src/adapter/batch-schema.ts:12"]}
