{"unit_id":"shinji00222__dsh-windows-computer-use#feature-1","repo":"shinji00222/dsh-windows-computer-use","commit":"33d281ab5bc9ac2e8fc16a86379cfbb17b5fe192","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Windows 电脑控制的功能「Windows 控件观察与填写」：调用 observe_text 读取可填写控件及短期有效的引用，再用 run_text_batch 最多连续执行八步；填写后回读值，点击和按键会结束批次。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/adapter/text-schema.ts:4"]}
{"unit_id":"shinji00222__dsh-windows-computer-use#feature-2","repo":"shinji00222/dsh-windows-computer-use","commit":"33d281ab5bc9ac2e8fc16a86379cfbb17b5fe192","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Windows 电脑控制的功能「截图驱动的批量操作」：先取得目标窗口截图，再通过 run_batch 按截图坐标执行最多八个动作并返回最终截图；可设置检查点，DSH 中要求当前模型支持图片输入。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/adapter/batch-schema.ts:12","src/adapter/plugin.ts:27"]}
{"unit_id":"shinji00222__dsh-windows-computer-use#feature-3","repo":"shinji00222/dsh-windows-computer-use","commit":"33d281ab5bc9ac2e8fc16a86379cfbb17b5fe192","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Windows 电脑控制的功能「请求用户接手验证步骤」：遇到需要人工完成的步骤时调用 request_human，由 DSH 审批流程等待用户操作并允许后续继续。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/adapter/plugin.ts:38"]}
{"unit_id":"shinji00222__dsh-windows-computer-use#feature-4","repo":"shinji00222/dsh-windows-computer-use","commit":"33d281ab5bc9ac2e8fc16a86379cfbb17b5fe192","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Windows 电脑控制的功能「查询操作历史」：调用 windows_computer_use_operation_history 查询当前对话近期操作的状态与批次结果，供中断后重新观察目标再继续。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/adapter/server.ts:44","src/adapter/history.ts:18"]}
{"unit_id":"shinji00222__dsh-windows-computer-use#caveat-1","repo":"shinji00222/dsh-windows-computer-use","commit":"33d281ab5bc9ac2e8fc16a86379cfbb17b5fe192","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Windows 电脑控制使用本机 Windows UI Automation 与桌面输入；目标应用必须能被该环境访问，截图批处理在 DSH 中还要求支持图片输入的模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/Engine/DesktopEngine.csproj:1","src/adapter/plugin.ts:27"]}
{"unit_id":"shinji00222__dsh-windows-computer-use#caveat-2","repo":"shinji00222/dsh-windows-computer-use","commit":"33d281ab5bc9ac2e8fc16a86379cfbb17b5fe192","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Windows 电脑控制会把验证码或需要人工完成的步骤交给 DSH 审批流程；如果审批服务不可用或策略禁止弹窗，人工交接会失败。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/adapter/handoff.ts:11","src/adapter/handoff.ts:16"]}
